  <div class="w-embed"></div><div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8da5a0df461d5d.jpg"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Villa du Pénéquet</div><h1 class="light">"A villa with private pool! What else do you need on holiday?", he replied.</h1></div></div></div><div class="room-subhero-section"><div class="container"><div class="banner"><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="banner-collection-list w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-775a29094f4579.svg"/><p class="faq-question-title">Private Pool</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/><p class="faq-question-title">Garden View</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-3874f118411b98.png"/><p class="faq-question-title">Extra Bed (+€80/n)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-halves"><div class="main-content"><p class="feature-paragraph smaller">2-floor Pool Villa - 2 people max - 80m2 (extra bed possible with surcharge)</p><h3>Villa du Pénéquet</h3><p>The Villas du Pénéquet–the Provençal word for power-nap–are the only suites boasting two floors. Downstairs houses the luxurious living area with direct access to your own private pool and sun loungers. On the first floor, we find the master bedroom and a bathroom with a large bathtub and separate walk-in shower.</p><p class="italics">Choose this one if you want the biggest suite on 2 floors and a private pool, with the possibility to add an extra bed. For the art patron.</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button w-button" href="https://app.mews.com/distributor/150bd326-7c63-4a24-b668-abcf00c6bb22" target="_blank">Check Now</a></div></div><div class="secondary-content"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bath tub</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free WiFi</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Hair dryer</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Walk-in Shower</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Smart TV</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Kettle</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free toiletries</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Slippers</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bathrobes</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Outdoor furniture</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Safety box</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Ironing facilities</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Soundproofing</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Room Service</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Minibar</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="full-frame-slider-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="500" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="3"><div class="slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-9502e1df731900.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-349656ba278524.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e265f734d81404.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-4c4dc25781ac9f.jpg"/></div></div></div><div class="left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="arrow left" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-62e87937b486a8.svg"/></div><div class="right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="arrow right" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-7d7a86fb467f08.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round"></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="grid-layout"><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding"><p class="feature-paragraph">The perfect fusion of clean contemporary lines and traditional design with lots of authentic charm. An ideal hideaway for couples or friends to enjoy a refined, relaxing holiday together.</p></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-2288c37159b2c6.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Carefully selected details for an enjoyable and most carefree stay.</p></div></div></div><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb56b"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed small-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-a4e3143aa87a88.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>A sumptuous bathtub design that offers spectacular views from both the bedroom and bathroom.</p></div></div><div class="divider _96px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb577"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-229821379c1145.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Clean, minimalistic lines come to life through thoughtful design touches.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-96" style="background-color:#838a7b"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper width-small centered"><p class="feature-paragraph" style="color:#fafaf8">Our inviting Suites are all different, which makes them unique.</p><p style="color:#fafaf8">Example of Suite layout.<br/>(plans are indicative and non binding)</p></div><img alt="" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-3be9cef4c2b08b.png"/></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Explore other Suites</h2></div></div><div class="rooms-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="room-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suiteaartiste.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de l'Artiste" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e1708f1e9761a9.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de l'Artiste</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suite-cabanat.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Cabanat" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-826f21859fa23e.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Cabanat</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a aria-current="page" class="room-link-block w-inline-block w--current" href="."><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt